<title>UK: Molins tumbles on accounting inquiry.</title>
<headline>Molins tumbles on accounting inquiry.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Molins Plc tumbled in pre-market trade on Tuesday after the packaging equipment maker revealed the results of an accounting investigation into its U.S. unit Langston.</p>
<p>The stock was quoted down 64p or 13 percent at 435p by 0720 GMT.</p>
</text>
